OL,3,A'This is sabotage': Hegseth defends
OL,4,AIran war record after Republican
OL,5,Alaunches impeachment attempt
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth
OL,8,Fdefends his record at his first news
OL,9,Fconference in six months after a
OL,10,FRepublican congressman launched an
OL,11,Fattempt to impeach him
OL,13,FSpeaking at the Pentagon, the defence
OL,14,Fsecretary calls the impeachment effort
OL,15,Fa "farce" and defends the US's "lawful
OL,16,Fmilitary operations"
OL,18,FHegseth adds: "This is not patriotism.
OL,19,FThis is sabotage"
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
