OL,3,A'This is sabotage': Hegseth defends
OL,4,AIran war record after Republican
OL,5,Alaunches impeachment attempt
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe has faced criticism of his handling
OL,8,Fof the Iran war from both Democrats and
OL,9,FRepublicans, but President Donald Trump
OL,10,Fsays his secretary of war gets an "'A'
OL,11,FPLUS" for his performance
OL,13,FArticles of impeachment were introduced
OL,14,Finto the House of Representatives on
OL,15,FMonday by Republican Thomas Massie, who
OL,16,Fsays the defence secretary violated the
OL,17,Fconstitution by not seeking approval
OL,18,Ffor the war
